  <History Date="13-04-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="04-10-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="26-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Tidied CTO functions and removed invalid palettes" />
  <History Date="26-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from SL Wash 350 RGBW to SL Wash 350" />
  <History Date="27-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed P/T Time to locate at zero for Capture compatibility." />
  <History Date="20-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed master dimmer to dimmer and dimmer to colourintensity in HSIC modes for compatibility." />
  <History Date="20-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added channel counts to mode names.  Fixed mapping in HSIC, 3 Cell mode." />
